sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API
    participant SyncApp as Sync
    participant ConnFacade as Connections facade
    participant DB

    User->>API: POST /sync-rules
    API->>SyncApp: CreateSyncRule(cmd)
    SyncApp->>ConnFacade: GetCalendarAccess(sourceCalID)
    ConnFacade-->>SyncApp: Read
    SyncApp->>ConnFacade: GetCalendarAccess(targetCalID)
    ConnFacade-->>SyncApp: ReadWrite
    SyncApp->>SyncApp: NewSyncRule(validate S1-S4, S7, S9)
    SyncApp->>DB: save rule (status=active)
    SyncApp-->>User: 201 {rule_id, status: active}

    Note over User, DB: Archive

    User->>API: PATCH /sync-rules/{id}/status {archived}
    API->>SyncApp: Archive(ruleID)
    SyncApp->>DB: load rule
    SyncApp->>SyncApp: Archive() — clear syncToken
    SyncApp->>DB: persist
    SyncApp-->>User: 200 {status: archived}

    Note over User, DB: Resume

    User->>API: PATCH /sync-rules/{id}/status {active}
    API->>SyncApp: Resume(ruleID)
    SyncApp->>ConnFacade: GetCalendarAccess(sourceCalID)
    ConnFacade-->>SyncApp: Read
    SyncApp->>ConnFacade: GetCalendarAccess(targetCalID)
    ConnFacade-->>SyncApp: ReadWrite
    SyncApp->>SyncApp: Resume(validate S2-S3, S7-S8)
    SyncApp->>DB: persist
    SyncApp-->>User: 200 {status: active}
